a number of feet equal to your Dexterity modifier.","usesMax":0,"usesSpent":0,"recharge":"none","id":"nyx-feat-6"},{"name":"Fiendish Legacy","source":"Tiefling","description":"Resistance to Fire damage. You know Thaumaturgy; at level 3, Hellish Rebuke 1/day.","usesMax":1,"usesSpent":0,"recharge":"long","id":"nyx-feat-7"}],"languages":["Common","Infernal","Deep Speech","Thieves'' Cant"],"armor":"Light armor","weapons":"Simple weapons, Hand Crossbows, Longswords, Rapiers, Shortswords","tools":"Thieves'' Tools, Disguise Kit"},"journal":{"personality":"Answers questions with another question.","ideals":"Locks are an opinion, not a law.","bonds":"She owes her life to an old pickpocket who can no longer work. She sends him money.","flaws":"Cannot walk past a locked safe.","backstory":"She grew up on the rooftops of the Salt Quarter. The guild wanted her; she preferred to freelance and is still paying for it.","allies":"Corvo, the old pickpocket. A customs contact who warns her about raids.","notes":"House Verrin put a price on her head after the necklace business."}}'::jsonb),
  ('a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004', 'Sister Maren', '{"id":"a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004","schemaVersion":2,"createdAt":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","identity":{"name":"Sister Maren","player":"","className":"Cleric","subclass":"Life Domain","level":3,"species":"Aasimar","background":"Acolyte","alignment":"Neutral","xp":0,"portrait":"assets/portraits/cleric.svg","accent":"#e8c15a","tagline":"The light does not ask permission"},"abilities":{"str":13,"dex":10,"con":14,"int":11,"wis":17,"cha":13},"saves":{"str":0,"dex":0,"con":0,"int":0,"wis":1,"cha":1},"skills":{"acrobatics":0,"animalHandling":0,"arcana":0,"athletics":0,"deception":0,"history":0,"insight":1,"intimidation":0,"investigation":0,"medicine":1,"nature":0,"perception":0,"performance":0,"persuasion":1,"religion":1,"sleightOfHand":0,"stealth":0,"survival":0},"combat":{"armorClass":18,"speed":30,"initiativeBonus":0,"hpMax":24,"hpCurrent":24,"hpTemp":0,"hitDieSize":8,"hitDiceTotal":3,"hitDiceSpent":0,"deathSuccesses":0,"deathFailures":0,"heroicInspiration":false,"exhaustion":0,"conditions":[],"attacks":[{"name":"Mace","ability":"str","proficient":true,"damage":"1d6","damageType":"Bludgeoning","range":"Melee","mastery":"Sap","notes":"","id":"maren-atk-1"},{"name":"Light Crossbow","ability":"dex","proficient":true,"damage":"1d8","damageType":"Piercing","range":"80/320 ft.","mastery":"Slow","notes":"","id":"maren-atk-2"},{"name":"Sacred Flame","ability":"wis","proficient":true,"damage":"2d8","damageType":"Radiant","range":"60 feet","mastery":"—","notes":"Cantrip. Dexterity save, ignores Cover.","id":"maren-atk-3"}]},"spellcasting":{"ability":"wis","slots":[{"level":1,"total":4,"used":1},{"level":2,"total":2,"used":0}],"spells":[{"name":"Sacred Flame","level":0,"school":"Evocation","castingTime":"1 action","range":"60 feet","components":"V, S","duration":"Instantaneous","concentration":false,"ritual":false,"prepared":true,"description":"Dexterity save or 2d8 Radiant damage. Ignores Cover.","id":"maren-spell-1"},{"name":"Thaumaturgy","level":0,"school":"Transmutation","castingTime":"1 action","range":"30 feet","components":"V, S","duration":"Up to 1 min","concentration":false,"ritual":false,"prepared":true,"description":"A booming voice, faint tremors, doors that swing open on their own.","id":"maren-spell-2"},{"name":"Guidance","level":0,"school":"Divination","castingTime":"1 action","range":"Touch","components":"V, S","duration":"Conc., 1 min","concentration":true,"ritual":false,"prepared":true,"description":"+1d4 to one of the target''s ability checks.","id":"maren-spell-3"},{"name":"Cure Wounds","level":1,"school":"Abjuration","castingTime":"1 action","range":"Touch","components":"V, S","duration":"Instantaneous","concentration":false,"ritual":false,"prepared":true,"description":"Restores 2d8 + spellcasting modifier (with Disciple of Life, +2 more).","id":"maren-spell-4"},{"name":"Bless","level":1,"school":"Enchantment","castingTime":"1 action","range":"Touch","components":"V, S, M","duration":"Conc., 1 min","concentration":true,"ritual":false,"prepared":true,"description":"Up to three creatures add 1d4 to attack rolls and saving throws.","id":"maren-spell-5"},{"name":"Shield of Faith","level":1,"school":"Abjuration","castingTime":"1 Bonus Action","range":"60 feet","components":"V, S","duration":"Conc., 10 min","concentration":true,"ritual":false,"prepared":false,"description":"+2 AC to the target.","id":"maren-spell-6"},{"name":"Spiritual Weapon","level":2,"school":"Evocation","castingTime":"1 Bonus Action","range":"60 feet","components":"V, S","duration":"1 min","concentration":false,"ritual":false,"prepared":true,"description":"A spectral weapon: 1d8 + modifier Force damage; you move it and attack as a Bonus Action.","id":"maren-spell-7"},{"name":"Lesser Restoration","level":2,"school":"Abjuration","castingTime":"1 action","range":"Touch","components":"V, S","duration":"Instantaneous","concentration":false,"ritual":false,"prepared":true,"description":"Ends one disease or one condition: Blinded, Deafened, Paralyzed or Poisoned.","id":"maren-spell-8"},{"name":"Aid","level":2,"school":"Abjuration","castingTime":"1 action","range":"30 feet","components":"V, S","duration":"8 hours","concentration":false,"ritual":false,"prepared":true,"description":"Three creatures raise their Hit Point maximum and current Hit Points by 5. Always prepared (domain).","id":"maren-spell-9"}],"notes":"Prepares 7 spells/day (WIS +3, level 3). Life Domain spells are always prepared."},"inventory":{"coins":{"pp":0,"gp":18,"ep":0,"sp":0,"cp":0},"items":[{"name":"Mace","quantity":1,"weight":4,"attuned":false,"equipped":true,"notes":"","id":"maren-item-1"},{"name":"Shield","quantity":1,"weight":6,"attuned":false,"equipped":true,"notes":"+2 AC (already included).","id":"maren-item-2"},{"name":"Chain Mail","quantity":1,"weight":55,"attuned":false,"equipped":true,"notes":"","id":"maren-item-3"},{"name":"Holy Symbol","quantity":1,"weight":1,"attuned":false,"equipped":true,"notes":"A pewter sun. Spellcasting focus.","id":"maren-item-4"},{"name":"Healer''s Kit","quantity":1,"weight":3,"attuned":false,"equipped":false,"notes":"10 uses. Stabilizes with no roll.","id":"maren-item-5"},{"name":"Holy Water (flask)","quantity":2,"weight":1,"attuned":false,"equipped":false,"notes":"","id":"maren-item-6"},{"name":"Acolyte''s vestments","quantity":1,"weight":4,"attuned":false,"equipped":false,"notes":"","id":"maren-item-7"},{"name":"Rations","quantity":7,"weight":2,"attuned":false,"equipped":false,"notes":"","id":"maren-item-8"}],"notes":""},"features":{"entries":[{"name":"Channel Divinity","source":"Cleric","description":"Two uses per rest. Fuels Turn Undead and Preserve Life.","usesMax":2,"usesSpent":0,"recharge":"short","id":"maren-feat-1"},{"name":"Turn Undead","source":"Cleric","description":"Each Undead within 30 feet must succeed on a Wisdom save or flee for 1 minute.","usesMax":0,"usesSpent":0,"recharge":"none","id":"maren-feat-2"},{"name":"Preserve Life","source":"Life Domain","description":"Spend Channel Divinity to split 5 × your level in Hit Points among creatures within 30 feet, up to half their maximum.","usesMax":0,"usesSpent":0,"recharge":"none","id":"maren-feat-3"},{"name":"Disciple of Life","source":"Life Domain","description":"Your level 1+ healing spells restore 2 + the spell level extra Hit Points.","usesMax":0,"usesSpent":0,"recharge":"none","id":"maren-feat-4"},{"name":"Celestial Revelation","source":"Aasimar","description":"As a Bonus Action, transform 1/Long Rest: wings or radiant burst, plus extra Radiant damage.","usesMax":1,"usesSpent":0,"recharge":"long","id":"maren-feat-5"}],"languages":["Common","Celestial"],"armor":"Light and Medium armor, Shields","weapons":"Simple weapons","tools":"None"},"journal":{"personality":"Listens all the way through before answering. Always.","ideals":"Nobody is left behind over what it costs to save them.","bonds":"The temple of Elyon raised her. She will go back when this is over.","flaws":"Holds herself responsible for wounds she could not have prevented.","backstory":"Left as a child on temple steps, she grew up among the sick and the dying. The celestial mark showed at fifteen, and with it the certainty that she was not meant to stay home.","allies":"Brother Tobin, who writes to her. Brann, who owes her a side.","notes":"A fever is running through the Green River villages and it does not answer to magic."}}'::jsonb)
on conflict (id) do nothing;
